---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Online Ruler"
  description="Privacy policy and data transparency details for Online Ruler, covering cookie usage, Google AdSense, analytics, and screen calibration storage."
>
  <header class="app-header">
    <a href="/" class="app-title">Online Ruler</a>
    <span class="app-tagline">privacy policy</span>
  </header>

  <main class="info-content">
    <div class="info-inner">
      <section class="info-section">
        <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p><em>Last updated: November 1, 2026</em></p>
        <p>
          At Online Ruler (<a href="https://onlineruler.deviloper.dev">onlineruler.deviloper.dev</a>),
          part of the <a href="https://deviloper.dev">deviloper.dev</a> network of utility tools, we respect your privacy
          and are committed to transparency. This Privacy Policy outlines what information is processed when you use our tool.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="info-section">
        <h2>No Personal Data or Measurements Stored</h2>
        <p>
          Online Ruler runs entirely client-side inside your browser via the HTML5 Canvas API and JavaScript.
          We do not record, transmit, or store any of your screen measurements, marker coordinates, or browser viewport data
          on external servers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="info-section">
        <h2>Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. To serve relevant ads, Google and its advertising partners
          may use cookies and web beacons.
        </p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Third-party vendor cookies:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve
            ads based on your previous visits to this website or other sites on the Internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Personalized advertising:</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners
            to serve ads to you based on your visit to our site and other destinations across the web.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Opting out:</strong> You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
            <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.
            You can also opt out of third-party advertising cookies by visiting
            <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aboutads.info</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="info-section">
        <h2>Analytics & Google Consent Mode v2</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to collect aggregated, anonymous statistics such as page views, device types,
          and general visitor demographics.
        </p>
        <p>
          We implement Google Consent Mode v2: analytics storage and ad storage remain set to <code>denied</code>
          by default until you accept cookies via the consent banner.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="info-section">
        <h2>Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          Online Ruler uses your browser's <code>localStorage</code> for two functional purposes only:
        </p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li><strong>Screen PPI calibration:</strong> Storing your calibrated PPI (pixels per inch) value so you don't have to re-calibrate each visit.</li>
          <li><strong>Cookie consent:</strong> Remembering your cookie preference (accepted or declined).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="info-section">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this policy, visit our parent domain at
          <a href="https://deviloper.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">deviloper.dev</a>.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <a href="/" class="back-link">← Return to Online Ruler</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <footer class="info-footer">
        <p>A free tool by <a href="https://deviloper.dev" rel="author">deviloper.dev</a></p>
        <p><a href="/">Online Ruler Home</a> · <a href="https://character-counter.deviloper.dev">CharCap</a></p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .app-header {
    height: 52px;
    padding: 0 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .app-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  .app-tagline {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .info-content {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    padding: 0 24px 64px;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 52px);
  }

  .info-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-top: 48px;
  }

  .info-section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .info-section h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .info-section p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .info-section a {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .policy-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .policy-list li {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .policy-list strong {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--fg) !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    background: var(--hover);
  }

  .info-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 14px;
    opacity: 0.6;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .info-footer a {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
</style>
